Model outputs were generated through the APIs of the providers named in each record
(Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, xAI, and Alibaba via OpenRouter) and through local open-weight
models. Their use also remains subject to those providers' terms.

Please cite the paper (see README.md) when using this data.
